  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math> solution was made by adding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The normality of the solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is _______</p><p>(The atomic mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Na</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>23</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equivalent of solute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Mole of solute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>106</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>43</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>106</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>286</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>",
